ows)\n\nThis doesn't seem to prove the issue to be fixed.  The issue claims temp tables getting dropped causes catalog changes.  Just because the catalog version didn't change, it doesn't mean there are zero catalog changes.  And your sample query only involves a single temp table whereas the issue is concerned with multiple temp tables.\n\npython/yugabyte/pg_regress_postprocess_output.py still has a workaround for this issue.  It should be closed once that workaround is validated to no longer need to exist.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2686496562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":16488474658,"node_id":"REE_lADOBlCVUc4bucpazwAAAAPWyigi","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/16488474658","actor":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959